From f920143e3d77147e34a28eaf355754fbbf649645 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 05:33:09 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/9] platform-spine: require completion record before payment;
 persist payment receipts

- PATCH /v1/jobs/{id}/status: completion -> payment now needs a job_completions row (409 COMPLETION_REQUIRED)
- payment.completed is persisted (payment_receipts, migration 0006) instead of skipped when the job is not yet at completion; the advance runs when either the event arrives or the completion record is logged
- concurrent duplicate completion submissions return 409 ALREADY_COMPLETED instead of 500
- regression tests for all of the above

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
