Subject: [PATCH 7/9] platform-spine, quotation: admin adds contractors;
 validate and normalise emails; stop leaking jobs and quotations to rig owners

platform-spine
- POST /v1/admin/contractors (admin only) creates a contractor; works when public contractor sign-up is closed. GET /v1/admin/users lists accounts (no hashes), optional role filter.
- emails are lower-cased on register/login/admin-create; lookups compare lower-cased so mixed-case accounts created earlier still sign in; 'Asha@x.com' and 'asha@x.com' are no longer two accounts
- GET /v1/jobs, /v1/jobs/{id}, /v1/jobs/{id}/completion/result refuse resource_owner (they used to return every customer's job, location and phone)

quotation
- quotation reads refuse any role outside customer/contractor/admin

